43.1 Entire agreement. This Agreement, the privacy policy, the refund policy, and the terms of service at https://hooxie.com/terms are the whole agreement between you and Delexo about the Software. They replace earlier oral and written statements on that subject, including statements in a demo, a chat, or an advertisement. If the terms of service conflict with this Agreement, this Agreement controls. If the privacy policy conflicts on a privacy practice, the privacy policy controls. If the refund policy conflicts on the timing or amount of a refund, the refund policy controls.

